# 自带技能目录安全策略：禁止提交任何可能包含敏感信息的文件
# Security policy for bundled skills: never commit secrets or live configs.

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
secrets.*
*secret*
*apikey*
*api-key*
*api_key*

# Live configs (use config.example.json for templates)
config.json
_config.json
*.config.json

# Certificates / keys
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Skill package artifacts
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Runtime / cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log

# Keep SKILL.md and examples tracked
!SKILL.md
!*.example.*
!README.md
